Today we started the Git and Github learnig 
step 1 - 
git init (Apne computer me naya project folder shuru karna)

git clone (GitHub se koi bani-banai file apne laptop par lana)

git add . (Apni files ko save karne ke liye taiyar karna)  (Ya fir saari files ke liye git add . likh sakte hain)

git commit -m "Mera pehla change" (Badlavon ko ek naam dekar lock karna)

git push (Apne laptop ka sara kaam internet par GitHub par upload kar dena)


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Step 2 - 
git config --global user.name "Hemant Vijay"
git config --global user.email "hemantvijay.vijay@gmail.com"

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Step - 3 

Jaise hi repo banegi, GitHub aapko ek page dikhayega jisme kuch commands likhi hongi.
 Aapko unme se "…or push an existing repository from the command line" waale section ki commands ko ek-ek karke apne terminal me chalan hai:

Bash
# 1. Branch ka naam main set karne ke liye
git branch -M main   


# 2. Apne local folder ko GitHub ke online folder se jodne ke liye (Apna URL copy karna)
git remote add origin https://github.com/hemant vijay/Azure-Learning.git

# 3. File ko internet par bhejne ke liye
git push -u origin main
Note: Jab aap pehli baar git push karenge, toh ek chota sa pop-up window khulega jo aapse GitHub login karne ko kahega (Sign in with your browser). Bas allow kar dena.git push -u origin main